@host = http://localhost:5207

### Lay danh sach
GET {{host}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Tim theo ten
GET {{host}}/api/customers?search=jo

### Lay mot khach hang
GET {{host}}/api/customers/2

### Khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/customers/999

### Tao moi -> 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alice Nguyen", "email": "alice@example.com" }

### Cap nhat -> 204
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/2
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jane Smith (da doi)", "email": "jane@example.com" }

### Xoa -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/3

### User
POST {{host}}/user
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "an" }
